    },
    "message": "Move the zone conditions, person contexts and proximity sampling to Rust\n\nThe read-only rules that had no Rust path: zone_environment_view and its\neight formulas, PersonContext as a view reads it, the check of which\npsychology reads beliefs, DistanceSampledProximityPolicy.sample and its\nstep, and what _schedule_information_contact raised for a contact that is\nnot an event. Values, formula meaning and coefficients are unchanged, and\nthe Python rules stay as the comparison base.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
