    },
    "message": "Keep the proximity step's patches and the narrowed shadow honest, and close test gaps\n\nA patch of _sample_proximity_contacts sends the tick to the phases like the\ndriver's other steps. shadow_read_rules keeps every tick on the Python path,\nwithout which it saw nothing when run alone while the hashes passed. The 1%\nmutants of the bounds, list lengths, end of Run and refused contact were not\nseen by the tests; these are.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
